instead of into the subdominant. Whether such is possible depends on the preceding chords. As *f¹* does not occur on the Harmonical, I played Ex. 3 on my just concertina in *A₁* major as *d'* *f₁'*♯ *b₁'*, *e₁'* *g₂'*♯ *b₁'*, @@A@@
